manifestVersion: 1.1
id: ordexcoin
category: bitcoin
name: OrdexCoin Node
version: "__VERSION__"
tagline: Run your personal OrdexCoin node
icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rnts08/OrdexCoin-Umbrel-app/main/ordexcoin/icon.svg
description: >-
  Run a full OrdexCoin node, powered by OrdexCoin Core v25.0 (vASERT).

  Independently store and validate every transaction. The bundled web interface
  shows node status, balances, transactions and addresses, lets you send OXC and
  gives you an RPC console — all served locally from your own node.

  Don't trust. Verify.

  Based on Bitcoin Core v25.0. Free and open source (MIT). Support development
  from the About page of the app.
